      "text": "card: where the host draws Keel cards, the user sees what follows as a card carrying its name, links and ids, so a reply can call it by name; the ids and links here serve tool calls and hosts without cards.\n\nMap a strategy's settings · Lookback map of Momentum rotation v3 · version 1 · Done · Oct 29\nDays Mar 23, 2025 to Oct 29, 2026, split Apr 17, 2026 · 6 coins: chosen by hand · costs 9 bp a fill · data as of Oct 29, 2026\nIn short:\n- Nearby settings as a share of yours: not measured, no interval (your setting's Sharpe is not positive, so a share of it has no meaning); Mar 23, 2025 to Oct 28, 2026\n- Rank among nearby settings: 1 of 3, no interval; Mar 23, 2025 to Oct 28, 2026\n- Rank agreement before and after the split: not measured, no interval (No range shown: these numbers use the same days); Mar 23, 2025 to Oct 28, 2026\nRuns: 0 runs, 0 reused, none failed\nCharts (4): Lookback · Before vs after the split · Every setting · The selected setting and its neighbours. keel_research_get(study_id=\"stu_000006\", view=0) reads the numbers behind any of them.\nMeasured with nearby settings and before and after the split.\nMomentum rotation v3 has a newer version, v4. Plan it: keel_research_plan(study_id=\"stu_000006\", source=\"Study(\\n    title=\\\"Lookback map of Momentum rotation v3\\\",\\n)\\n\\nSubjects(\\n    v3=Strategy(\\\"str_momrotpro00000000000000000@4\\\"),\\n)\\n\\nRun(\\n    days=Days(\\\"2025-03-23\\\", \\\"2026-10-29\\\"),\\n    split=Split(\\\"2026-04-17\\\"),\\n    coins=Coins([\\\"BTC\\\", \\\"ETH\\\", \\\"SOL\\\", \\\"HYPE\\\", \\\"XRP\\\", \\\"DOGE\\\"], chosen=ByHand()),\\n    costs=Costs(fee=0.00045, slippage=0.00045),\\n    data=Data(\\\"snap_6c1f0e8a2b9d4f37\\\"),\\n)\\n\\nSteps(\\n    map=SettingsGrid(axes=[SettingAxis(\\\"step[2].period\\\", [5, 10, 20], name=\\\"lookback\\\")]),\\n    split=SplitCompare(grid=\\\"map\\\"),\\n    nearby=Neighbours(grid=\\\"map\\\"),\\n)\\n\\nViews(\\n    Page(default=\\\"Lookback\\\", switch=[\\\"Lookback\\\", \\\"Before vs after the split\\\", \\\"Every setting\\\"]),\\n    Curve(\\\"Lookback\\\", of=\\\"map\\\", x=Axis(\\\"lookback\\\"), y=Raw(Control(\\\"measure\\\", \\\"sharpe\\\", options=[\\\"sharpe\\\", \\\"cagr\\\", \\\"max_drawdown\\\"])), marks=[Ring(Yours())]),\\n    Scatter(\\\"Before vs after the split\\\", of=\\\"split\\\", x=Raw(\\\"sharpe_before\\\"), y=Raw(\\\"sharpe_after\\\")),\\n    Distribution(\\\"Every setting\\\", of=\\\"map\\\", x=Raw(\\\"sharpe\\\")),\\n    Bars(\\\"The selected setting and its neighbours\\\", of=\\\"nearby\\\", x=Axis(\\\"lookback\\\"), y=Raw(\\\"sharpe\\\")),\\n)\\n\", base={\"version\": 1, \"revision\": 1, \"evidence_hash\": \"08393f8546af57ecf0cfaca649ada9d481cffc26cfa210adeb1a35b7567b77c3\"})\nView in Keel: https://app.usekeel.io/research/stu_000006",
